    "text": "# widget\n\n[![CI](https://github.com/acme/widget/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/acme/widget/actions)\n\nWidget turns CSV files into clean charts from the command line.\n\n![demo](docs/demo.gif)\n\n## Installation\n\n```sh\ncargo install widget\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n```sh\nwidget plot data.csv --out chart.png\n```\n\n## Contributing\n\nSee [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md).\n"
